WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.083 --> 00:00:03.750
2.4 billion women globally

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:06.543
are not afforded equal
economic opportunity.

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:10.500
In Brazil, women earn an average

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:13.833
of 30% less than men
and many are unbanked.

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:19.650
Most of the people in
Brazil are still unbanked

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:21.240
in the means of they don't have

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:24.330
fair interest rates, especially women.

00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:26.973
The gender inequality is immense.

00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:30.510
They don't have fair interest rates

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:34.410
and access to credit like immediately,

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:38.532
and they go to department
stores to get like credit

00:00:38.532 --> 00:00:43.532
and the absurd interest rates
that they get is quite hard.

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:47.010
So I saw that challenge

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:48.990
and I told my dad like when I grow up,

00:00:48.990 --> 00:00:53.403
I will develop that bank that
will give priority to women.

00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:04.980
My name is Taynaah Reis.

00:01:04.980 --> 00:01:08.137
I'm the CEO and founder of Moeda Seeds.

00:01:08.137 --> 00:01:10.950
Moeda has been my mission in life.

00:01:10.950 --> 00:01:13.440
I see as a legacy because my father

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:16.803
started doing microcredit a long time ago.

00:01:18.210 --> 00:01:20.430
My father developed one of the largest

00:01:20.430 --> 00:01:23.820
microcredit programs for
the agriculture-run families

00:01:23.820 --> 00:01:25.830
and I would follow him everywhere

00:01:25.830 --> 00:01:28.950
to the cooperatives, the
indigenous communities.

00:01:28.950 --> 00:01:33.780
I see as well the potential
of technology to bring an idea

00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:38.780
to its financial ecosystem
of social good and greatness.

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:44.880
My father gave my first
computer when I was one year old

00:01:44.880 --> 00:01:48.240
and by the age of 12, I
was learning by myself

00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:50.010
many programming languages.

00:01:50.010 --> 00:01:53.070
I got to learn at a very young age

00:01:53.070 --> 00:01:56.553
technology and how could I help
and improve people's lives.

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:06.090
The spark of helping women
came from a young age

00:02:06.090 --> 00:02:09.540
because I saw the challenges
that they had to overcome,

00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:13.320
especially because Brazil is a country.

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:15.780
A government report found that 43%

00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:17.880
of Brazilian women have suffered violence

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:19.590
in their own homes.

00:02:19.590 --> 00:02:21.060
According to UN figures,

00:02:21.060 --> 00:02:24.633
a woman is assaulted every
15 seconds in Sao Paulo.

00:02:26.310 --> 00:02:28.830
But this rampant misogyny
doesn't stop at home

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:30.480
and in the streets.

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:31.920
Women struggle for inclusion

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:34.260
in the financial system as well.

00:02:34.260 --> 00:02:37.383
Six out of every 10 unbanked
Brazilians are women.

00:02:39.390 --> 00:02:40.860
The bank guarantees that they have

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:44.460
are in the name of the
father into the family.

00:02:44.460 --> 00:02:47.880
So I saw the challenge,
especially for women,

00:02:47.880 --> 00:02:51.840
to have access to credit
and fair interest rates.

00:02:51.840 --> 00:02:54.480
I see like that technology

00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:58.530
would help both to do
transactions for them

00:02:58.530 --> 00:03:02.100
to access capital and
people could see and trust

00:03:02.100 --> 00:03:05.523
that their money and their
investments is doing good.

00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:13.020
Blockchain is a technology

00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:16.350
that allows people to create trust.

00:03:16.350 --> 00:03:20.640
It holds information that is
crucial for people to measure

00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:24.630
in our case the impact investment,

00:03:24.630 --> 00:03:27.330
how many jobs we make
for each transaction,

00:03:27.330 --> 00:03:30.333
and the impact on the environmental.

00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:34.530
We use both blockchain and
artificial intelligence

00:03:34.530 --> 00:03:39.530
to create a gamified way to
help women to access credit

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:42.630
with the mentorship and
the guidance we created

00:03:42.630 --> 00:03:46.770
and develop a token that
incentivizes them along the way

00:03:46.770 --> 00:03:51.360
and by them like hiring
more women and having KPIs

00:03:51.360 --> 00:03:54.600
towards the social good
and impact that they do,

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:57.600
they can get discounts
on the interest rates

00:03:57.600 --> 00:04:01.230
and a lot of more benefits
within the network.

00:04:01.230 --> 00:04:04.260
The ecosystem Moeda
created allows for people

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:06.390
to access Moeda Pay,

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:07.980
a digital account that can be used

00:04:07.980 --> 00:04:10.020
for making payments, bank transfers,

00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:12.870
and transactions with
Bitcoin and other currency

00:04:12.870 --> 00:04:15.633
with a specialized QR
code and credit card.

00:04:17.220 --> 00:04:19.650
The MDA token was the first currency built

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:22.230
when Moeda was formed in 2017

00:04:22.230 --> 00:04:24.510
and is currently the only
one that can be traded

00:04:24.510 --> 00:04:27.453
in an open market or
directly between people.

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:31.470
The MDA token allows people

00:04:31.470 --> 00:04:33.780
from all over the world to directly invest

00:04:33.780 --> 00:04:37.353
in Moeda Seeds projects,
creating a global impact.

00:04:38.940 --> 00:04:42.090
Their other currencies
are varying purposes.

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:45.510
MDABRL is used solely
within Moeda's ecosystem

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:48.000
for people not prepared
to endure the volatility

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:52.710
of the cryptocurrency market
while MDA loyal rewards

00:04:52.710 --> 00:04:56.253
loyal social impact investors
with bonuses and incentives.

00:04:57.150 --> 00:05:00.990
Once the women they decide
to partner with Moeda Seeds,

00:05:00.990 --> 00:05:05.990
we offer them guidance and
mentorship, financial education,

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:10.830
literacy and entrepreneurship
program as well

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:14.460
that they can take and improve
their skills and abilities

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:19.443
and how to develop their small
and medium sized businesses.

00:05:23.310 --> 00:05:26.430
Five years ago talking
about blockchain technology

00:05:26.430 --> 00:05:29.970
and social impact investment
was quite challenging,

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:32.103
but today is easier.

00:05:34.710 --> 00:05:36.660
I saw the spark on their eyes

00:05:36.660 --> 00:05:41.460
and quite early the demand of
investments with a purpose.

00:05:41.460 --> 00:05:45.330
The impact goes among 150,000 users

00:05:45.330 --> 00:05:47.910
and more than one million
in capital deployed

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:51.630
along 28 beautiful
projects that we support.

00:05:51.630 --> 00:05:54.240
Taynaah is in the process
of raising additional funds

00:05:54.240 --> 00:05:57.690
to expand to over 2,000
projects in other regions

00:05:57.690 --> 00:06:00.540
in the hope of multiplying
an impact to millions.

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:04.110
I had many entrepreneurs from
the Latin America region.

00:06:04.110 --> 00:06:06.780
They have the same
challenges within Brazil,

00:06:06.780 --> 00:06:09.870
the financial education,
the access to credit,

00:06:09.870 --> 00:06:10.980
they all need that.

00:06:10.980 --> 00:06:14.790
Moeda seeds is ready to scale and grow.

00:06:14.790 --> 00:06:18.393
Many times I thought that
was impossible to achieve.

00:06:20.280 --> 00:06:23.610
When you think not only about yourself,

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:26.130
when you think about the
others and how technology

00:06:26.130 --> 00:06:30.120
can be a tool to help and
transform people's lives,

00:06:30.120 --> 00:06:32.790
all the universe can conspire

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:36.213
for you to achieve your goals and dreams.

